---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { sitePath } from '../lib/urls';
---

<Page
  article
  title="Contact & report a preview issue"
  description="Report a reproducible MutualLens preview issue on the project repository without sharing real account graphs, exports, credentials, or private information."
>
  <p class="eyebrow">PROJECT FEEDBACK</p><h1>
    Help make the preview clearer.
  </h1><p class="lede">
    MutualLens is a project by Arhaan Aggarwal. Public development feedback can
    be filed in the project’s GitHub issue tracker.
  </p>
  <a
    class="button primary"
    href="https://github.com/Arhaan2/mutuallens/issues"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >Open project issues <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
  >
  <h2>Make a useful report</h2><p>
    Include the browser, the action you attempted, the visible error, and a
    minimal synthetic example where possible. An interface screenshot should
    contain only sample data. Never post real account graphs, Instagram exports,
    credentials, cookies, or private identifying details in a public issue.
  </p>
  <h2>Private support is not configured yet</h2><p>
    A dedicated private support and privacy-request channel has not yet been
    supplied. No email address or postal address is invented here. The owner
    needs to provide and verify an appropriate channel before a public
    advertising launch.
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href={sitePath('/privacy/')}>Read the privacy draft</a> or <a
      href={sitePath('/about/')}>learn about the project</a
    >.
  </p>
</Page>
